---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Mark from "../components/Mark.astro";
import StackMap from "../components/StackMap.astro";
import StackMapKey from "../components/StackMapKey.astro";
---
<Base
  title="About inixiative: the whole map"
  description="The whole picture of what inixiative is building, and how the parts connect: the building blocks, the agentic tools and the governance designs."
  domain="inixiative"
  current="about"
>
  <section class="hero hero-split">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="hero-mark"><Mark /></span>
      <h1 class="display-1">The whole map.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The whole picture of what inixiative is building, and how the parts connect. The building blocks are a
        decade of lessons from building software, packaged as reusable pieces. The agentic tools get coding
        agents to use them. The governance designs are where it is all headed: tools for people, and their
        agents, to cooperate.
      </p>
      <StackMapKey view="whole" standalone />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-map">
      <StackMap view="whole" hero />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
